aper", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/CHANGELOG.md", "source_location": "L301", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_changelog_lighter_free_plan", "label": "Lighter on the free plan", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/CHANGELOG.md", "source_location": "L197", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "About 945 MB of downloads in one day, mostly one video reloaded on every visit, against a 5 GB monthly allowance; so videos load on Play, screenshots become WebP and files are reused for 5 minutes."}, {"id": "docs_changelog_device_notifications", "label": "Device notifications (web push)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/CHANGELOG.md", "source_location": "L230", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The server only accepts push addresses of the real browser push services, so nobody can make it call another URL."}, {"id": "docs_changelog_notification_bell", "label": "Notification bell and TicketRead", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/CHANGELOG.md", "source_location": "L280", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_changelog_my_inbox", "label": "My inbox, Messenger-style", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/CHANGELOG.md", "source_location": "L260", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_changelog_forgot_password", "label": "Forgot password request flow", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/CHANGELOG.md", "source_location": "L284", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_changelog_signup_approval", "label": "Sign-up with admin approval", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/CHANGELOG.md", "source_location": "L410", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_changelog_cloud_move", "label": "QA Hub moves to Vercel + Supabase", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/CHANGELOG.md", "source_location": "L290", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "So QA Hub no longer depends on the QA laptop being on; IT/DPO approved ticket data in the cloud."}, {"id": "docs_changelog_rls_no_policies", "label": "RLS on with no policies", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/CHANGELOG.md", "source_location": "L294", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Supabase's public API then reads nothing; only Prisma reaches the data."}, {"id": "docs_changelog_rate_limit_hit", "label": "RateLimitHit database counters", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/CHANGELOG.md", "source_location": "L294", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sign-in limits are counted in the database because serverless functions share no memory."}, {"id": "docs_changelog_signed_url_uploads", "label": "Direct signed-URL uploads", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/CHANGELOG.md", "source_location": "L295", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Browsers upload straight to the private bucket because Vercel caps requests at 4.5 MB; the server checks the real type, size and length afterwards."}, {"id": "docs_changelog_daily_cleanup", "label": "Daily clean-up cron (changelog)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/CHANGELOG.md", "source_location": "L296", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_changelog_backup_restore", "label": "lib/backup.ts backup and restore", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/CHANGELOG.md", "source_location": "L297", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_changelog_found